{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1286,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb7d56342f52b207c07a8c4e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "桀桀桀…状态真是绝佳！\r\n昨天的实验果然成功了。\r\n现在一定能拿出优异的成果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1302fe0b0d7ab18e49b1108e9af8b3a3d76e3d0f17ce6d731663e5ed1a977e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49f5124db50ae5989b5d24b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "或许是探讨光速不变原理的梦\r\n令我的大脑活跃起来了。\r\n我今天的状态绝佳呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1df8562cbac2784fbb317a91903363b94366dcf79769ddcd1b94f8ec0a6620f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23ad5e1fa135080d2a69abf5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯…感觉身体很轻盈呢。\r\n这样应该能比平时更\r\n全神贯注地进行研究。",
      "source_fingerprint": "418bc454ce2e334f45a1504ab770ec2ba27aab4f4c05170121d6f4c56b9678e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89b7217380102dda0292df95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赶快开始吧。\r\n毕竟要保持住这种干劲\r\n也相当不容易啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1d4b25018a68b40f38fc4420f4b3ac314a6e53a78fadcc12ef738798b68f5e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d39065acb6b42d93d1f81ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "气温、心跳和其他各项数值\r\n均与平时无异。也就是说\r\n我的状态跟往常一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "94b3ab2bf736219c10c547bdd3a95c3316c6b47ec9e4994ac27b446782d718f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea27848bacc67abcfa8a2bd8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯…总感觉有点犯懒…\r\n也会有这种日子呢…",
      "source_fingerprint": "8887b13eacb604e542f75680d63e32d453384d0c532ad2288da5abf475256a62",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66087245071c42359df3483f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然想尝试一下\n新的实验…哈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "55c4ff75501f8476c6e35eb503976a161bf48037c54c866e51acfa819565deba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef2ad63d315b70ccba38127c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊…总感觉状态很不好…\r\n话虽如此，要是不完成今天的计划\r\n也会影响到下次实验…",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d12e708bfb04a4c5f6d301560817a4047fda57d3f7a830b111ebcb9e05c47c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23a2194d07e2d605246f87f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…我的干劲现在好像失踪了呢…\r\n不过你放心，该做的我还是会去做的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0caa7df7daa196e41ec35ea0fbedc671f9d7be8da85903e6eaa1c698b27f0390",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13d1a533f51cbec6848355da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦呀，又要比赛？\r\n…真是的，把我累成这样\r\n难道你有什么企图不成？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a10aadac852520ef8a08c38a073ae468ac66ecc346c934dd596c90eca14a73bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab867a4bca2b3b94aad66de6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然在赛场收集数据也很重要，\r\n但这次应该在书桌上专心研究啊，\r\n不然除了积攒疲劳之外，得不到任何东西哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "90986ea0debc20b5eea7fc104fb0a49d117fc17426996e951c656778b7ed078b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c560c6ddbe8420ed0e8d367",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这完美的状态，\r\n正可谓研究的成果啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7580623489e0a8cf395cf4d43bc5be23e05051ef6c577e28a091d2d81a99526",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d34a9e30c1307501eb903a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊，好想赶快验证理论。\r\n真是的…一着急就容易\r\n产生毫无意义的亢奋！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f57641035a2fade9b8f3edbabc6a977c9e411fcdb85e47d2b8ee1d3606f351c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06fac09bf6b370adda74fdfa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "全身都在发热。…桀桀，仿佛全身的细胞\r\n都在命令我奔跑一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b1b2511b020a09b7d21632e3a8b53dacfe3753f9d4a0762b8983f8720ecb435",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db38187f9149ad142147fb6e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，迄今为止的实验似乎\r\n都成功了。准备得也很充分，\r\n就等结果了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "723e802c59e7eaf4c732610924adeb46a5c169fd206b31cfed4452987f5a416e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cda34ec50cc433d91444159b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "心情很好，状态不错。\r\n这样能得出怎样的结果呢\r\n开始实验吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ad2fb5aa15c8214916d9fd567e0ce7a03bbfc482a95d52e4012021822f64826",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63285b6cec379e8c711b983d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "桀桀桀…状态很棒。\r\n面对马娘们那绝佳的肉体\r\n我的干劲也提高了啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "efa3d12fd25588b17660d630030caa355e36eae4766c6bfe15ee5b30e325000d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:732193aa761809ec3330fc94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还没能达到增加细胞\r\n那种程度的实验…\r\n但从状态来看也不算差。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d5111943e6aeb28ace3662283db99ec1511c224d2d2a0050badceb938b109a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9790271b4f5179d723f0cd36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不好不坏，\r\n状态不错…\r\n能拿出怎样的结果呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "59b71438ebc6a625ff301155f9fc3abc82e2773cbeff6de15a3d60ffdae1b50d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7be353f92d7059bc4f20805e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态跟往常一样。\r\n平日的结果如何，\r\n你可得给我好好记录一下哦",
      "source_fingerprint": "e95d6d7817d7fd01752644f6c8925a17ec1d6f613e0bcb5ac4e70d0971c3a463",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:698b90b3719ae10a0faf1a9a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯…是我太专注于研究\r\n而没做好调整吗。\r\n算了，船到桥头自然直！",
      "source_fingerprint": "76bb9654edbc8e065ca5dd13266186b953064833e242c1e43638d0c69ee786ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c80c6b779097c96bde827b05",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "据说失败是成功之母。\r\n即便状态不佳，\r\n也能有所收获。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98e4f19f3a93fc97e6ec485b593c2e67fa62231c43ee08ece7e1d36d071255a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff2dc20e3d1221e27c68c45e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态不是很好，\r\n或许今天应该着重观察才对…",
      "source_fingerprint": "d772c264c669f1875bb6901fb1acfa2b2974cae46b53604912590c69954b18bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11f67981ac40f0642b90d4c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "凡事不总是一帆风顺的啊…\r\n现在状态不算好，\r\n算了，尽我所能吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b83a92fa4ddaeb72640f70c6d9a1f5d1d25b767ce2fdb2ca6ffc10d045c94e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d1ad98ec7a5109d25522370",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "倦怠…原因不明的倦怠感。\r\n但也有在这个状态下\r\n才能得到的数据…呼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc30e509a8bb359303330753483444d27e28e17a4943615e34f7a94c28705c1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e2703ef6218de857b0b0629",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态极差啊！\r\n差到我现在就想回家睡大觉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ef727da0990f405086ec1f4773434df47b11911ce16f58886c6d6b19831cbb1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc8d7effb1ffe0b5f3f183f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5340d32cafefeb07fb71f273be0d9e41c17a0c3f97ce3ec0784aa70ad39fd299",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9766cb66bf7fcd45da0690c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e2d53b9afc302fe6193a0f0c17c886a3d13d1fd0a390efb052c4a77ba94a09d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68da01bc31b27281444552dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉很有意思呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbdbeec2a7a053971213d485801dfadc521041a93c24268480bd066df083702f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c5c52658dc1f2f2fa8900fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "交给我吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0f70558d850ecc83c59a7f556d74001d25e024c7fa3678ca8a6cbcf1ef56f92",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b42b0d94293c8e201e0636a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "05e7370a30507c08e7c88f5cd20beba946c167e6356f5907582aada8cb498bdf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c429987c3234cecf883da5b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦呀？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c86f5ae001b4c8005e0478632e7cccc4e77b559324fa7c08f2250ac40b12c990",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96ac63e624884ccd63d119d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0f0665e0a69c08888c3252e4588492414e62eb2a101e0b2a5a81f3189d824bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e455d5052803929f048421ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "02cd6b35d4f141be59253fb500ef97b74206f2f2cd2d3fb1a7ba9ed4047d0164",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3285f9babe7b825e06e6474d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "研究可没有尽头哦，豚鼠君！",
      "source_fingerprint": "535a4e49c8914b81615f3bc3123f7bea74da5486bc441ea069d3dbc5d6c2bf1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fd78af50452723276ae4bdf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员君，来吧！一切都要重新验证！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3ee977c3f916d97475e041c9842faad94d687efb22062f8694436c2f3a41ac1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8d3716f58c7b09f8eaf53ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我观察一下哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "64e9b0f06deda02e97596b0761895ff29fa568ff6def9ff3e019ddd07e4819d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cac6ff86229079284c7cc87d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来，开始实验吧…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "98b360a0e3a6f6c0e5aabdddf66c7466879a88af205fa01d69681d5f5cfc296a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b455815d62ddba01e2b6004",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来，扩大可能性吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "168ab651ac3fda8c489a15fc46419d8a91230a7caf542572ec7294c526a97037",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:398a6856fc8070984d7590e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "研究可没有尽头哦，豚鼠君！",
      "source_fingerprint": "535a4e49c8914b81615f3bc3123f7bea74da5486bc441ea069d3dbc5d6c2bf1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8048218fafa60dcc33d3dfc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "桀桀桀…状态很棒。\r\n面对马娘们那绝佳的肉体，\r\n我的干劲也提高了啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3a1722c66b1cb60569e1397d7e0577a466640dc1565141adb3eff763ebb31b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0a81b7cb155c6648c51f355",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "全身都在发热。\r\n…桀桀，仿佛全身的细胞都在命令我奔跑一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "630e1605bf7e66fc477b8c20b92fdd99d88453c005589c1f279db761f5135a80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e71c31d97372da586c3b3ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "研究可没有尽头哦，豚鼠君！",
      "source_fingerprint": "535a4e49c8914b81615f3bc3123f7bea74da5486bc441ea069d3dbc5d6c2bf1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:268ee1eca63f1e5dcc890c85",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "始めよう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a91c3a42bee3b610a977d9d276cc865eacf6a6007436b210196e4495453836d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df90828cbe58fb845142afc5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个结果，看来实验成功了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8855932f28736b5c64983d04bbe3f159bd8065a1d4cdd572aa478836edc897c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:788f7bcb3fd7bf8ffb09044e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "得到有意思的数据了哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "15388bfedd93ddd86c9435336badd8164bddc474205714e1a16f525aaac6b5bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92aeffdb9673f431623d805d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，很有趣的结果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b40e0e100e9d0530c7594eb131bedb850377cfc125caccb49e08eb76ce768f6e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc567971792849e8f0d54bed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还需要再进行些研究。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e2d0b4c7372649bfdef46b57bad3e37f3e2025bec51cbd61a4f4d2eb7aa828c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e4b0e98f96c70688791d7a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "桀桀…这就是研究的成果啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae8c86536ebc80d85ef92175c824f36014968d3a2609a9f8463bbb9b7e1e0e3b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d830a84dd07c5ea0f69d0810",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，验证完毕。",
      "source_fingerprint": "494c215b2dfd1fdeee83fbf95a5f0cd40e0aa466f57445fd913de8207310b0ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c635b369f220d6052e81695",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……这段时光很有意义！",
      "source_fingerprint": "731a77f0bdf981def5e9190916418e65fe454dfad2e26a85b5c0f64301f12a7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e737d48fdadd4bc0cdf4c76e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼，验证完成了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b02135f273ee91d848be509bc693dae29663ff789aa25a0fc17cc6b9a785529d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a51fac880515b38cec0613c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これが可能性…いいものだねぇ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "784c358796290a67be8cc60c7b3283c3f9897e8c68587cf86a048724fa204a3f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "30206"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d5ecf7832b1b4c87edc68f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふぅっ、検証完了だ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "734e206c400a2d1c29a95977268004d318ef61778833ad7fc7d8efe381cb5bee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "30207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7683bf16ef75b3e68c287e79",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "去参赛吧…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a257aff91105cc6f39bc5cd90a2c4d1d724acbe2e5eb5eceae4394548f2bb8ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39ae62aa781a3709d1af0487",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来，将那可能性推导出来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "011bf4ec47c825598f3977314fb814aa8e75f0e59e18c8cf03320c05d64ed5fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d75fc0825d2c2011e81b4148",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "经过长期的团体集训活动后，\r\n赛马娘的身心会有什么的变化呢？\r\n──哎呀，真叫人期待！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b65d98ec97cddbdbf1242a6073faea9f101d734935f03f58159d2e0b20a803bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "400000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d03f7e427922b75c40c8240",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵。卖人情给学生会……\r\n喔，糟糕。\r\n我得努力让自己能够帮上忙才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff99baa1f13a9ecfa3f6fca636ed5b8c5f90d65dd43b99c61c05916a67ed5ec8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "400003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80497319deb1ff060df04e01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，得到了不错的数据！\r\n不只是赛马娘的各种身心变化……\r\n我自己的改变也让人很有兴趣。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbd37f9c86b87d4eac9168789fc084aa926c878f1acfa87af6a7254a9f32445c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "400009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bfef5b7aa84c5e84a8c08ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来，将那可能性推导出来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "011bf4ec47c825598f3977314fb814aa8e75f0e59e18c8cf03320c05d64ed5fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea1f7d67b0bbbfb02ae6264f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好了，开始吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ac748b29d0bf3eb338445183a7f076265274a1978807e7baa4ec4b888a6a89d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "40002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3098266477b1c58f245c149",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是革命性的化学反应！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f299a9e57417aa9e81d75afbe6fce42f721a02fd44c42cef6a7eb3f2940b92c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bdfc31077e776b2c907fac7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，现在开始才是重头戏……\r\n哈哈哈哈！要上啰，小奇！\r\n来，让我们好好享受一番吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "73d1b5dd507da7c4594cd430616ceacc03e2266cb2ee05a75c69b7b12974f4de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:382ad75038fa5dbfa3a7948b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これが…私の可能性…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1677855839bead6b6b6af04f33aeea6d6ee320c5def7c6985a95924c258117f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "40203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0c8983ee70b723ab68b8419",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "限りなくゼロでも…ゼロではない！\r\n見つけてしまった可能性…限界の先へ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf8e15b524da8edcadde454d809c2ba47f7f83aec4549c95fb0c5d64de8be107",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "40204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8c84d5340db9efb3fc93460",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "彼此都能得到有价值的东西就好了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3f0d6b1f74083c0320d10d60a90a5186476d3bef8d97cf5d20932fe3e7aaa15",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4170d51b68774c2b3b07469",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "难得的LIVE…可不能错过哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1bf48378d8d33a6864335856bea68e8e5f2268198322867d29ccbfc3a7658540",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b899b69de8ed0d8aa2087f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你也想见证可能性的话，就来帮忙吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b193abba5e17b9beb58df97c05d734fc941fe0715c40cd515e3660d52d721ff9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6f624f0e6105649211778b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我本以为你只是一只\r\n豚鼠而已…现在看来\r\n似乎不是那样呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "911b1992b995deb14c8df37901f3837375f883ffbb7cfb1c48f42b1d5381a256",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c35eb48d263034b626ace2be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然没什么特别之处，但穿起来感觉不错哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b06bb4993a67ee10ade750f4a425281d68bcb040ab2f8c7bac3f9f6a2f2549f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1db2040f75071d01923a1151",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "各方面制作起来都很容易的服装，\r\n但它能承受住剧烈运动吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b31b1d011719fc36f8a42534ebb360b2aa9fc2c102bdc69ba97ae47cf0a82d95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5217be3d97ebb2a794f8fdb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套衣服怎么样\r\n是不是正合适？",
      "source_fingerprint": "955e13562088bd8aabb88344539bf36d560c16a91021827496a2510ed1c73613",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d546d4f0b5112c4ab7a02f8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套衣服，在实验时\r\n弄坏了好几次呢…",
      "source_fingerprint": "3571f0d1b1de26cc59bd788f76aa816c5972daf22c73060c8aa41001218a53e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4df0e44e39fc0195fd62c76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这应该是世人眼中很可爱的一种服装吧，\r\n但说实话我不太能理解呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b374a12cf33110f6c18a05b179202e85f93fe082490391db5e9684dc20cf995",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72ca39db40c650ba86670a9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，穿上这套衣服，研究意愿就涌出来了！\r\n我可以做实验吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "088916a1719b597bb4cf7563e11f89559a0b9809dfa43d1cd0ddcc562d4e19ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c903a20ac94165da4ea84443",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你很好奇我的包包装了什么吗？\r\n呵呵，不告诉你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db7dac3e7ba2889cbf5e6a9b2b4c4538481b2f8b96c6d6c870549561262c12a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2f7939bbe466ac0c5119d36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能不能再多增加几支试管呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa2735fd8712ae680c5f04710d862035d5a94fc72372db8ac9844a16ce36a194",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:269e081e8c3bd3f9f1a29c0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a977ca8e3137e67a7a6918a06d3d86d57fbf577994f726c5155115e0a2b3071a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8acff465bd4236c71bd6a0fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走吧，向着那可能性的尽头……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "021c7308c082875485a9ba0a15577918a1e6ca33d79205d025fbfc5101a94246",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:149db17ca737e121732c1c9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总之，我穿上了手边的衣服。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b8dadbcbce9ddc368960f2b1e94e649dd9fb718967553a40035ed59e4fca32f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "70020"
      ]
    }
  ]
